#: src/features/guides/data/guides.ts:426
msgid "Common prefixes in daily technical work include milli (10⁻³), centi (10⁻²), deci (10⁻¹), deka (10¹), hecto (10²), and kilo (10³). Science and engineering add micro (10⁻⁶), nano (10⁻⁹), pico (10⁻¹²), mega (10⁶), giga (10⁹), and beyond."
msgstr "Les préfixes courants dans le travail technique quotidien incluent milli (10⁻³), centi (10⁻²), deci (10⁻¹), deka (10¹), hecto (10²) et kilo (10³). La science et l'ingénierie ajoutent le micro (10⁻⁶), le nano (10⁻⁹), le pico (10⁻¹²), le méga (10⁶), le giga (10⁹) et au-delà."

